### VTT Platform — Smoke Flow (8 requests)
### Format: REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client. Run sequentially, top to bottom.
###
### Variables — override at top:
@apiBase = https://vtt-server.onrender.com
@gmEmail = gm@example.com
@gmPassword = pass-123-pass
###
### Steps 1-5, 7-8 are REST. Step 6 (dice via WSS) lives in `socket-smoke.mjs`
### in this same folder — REST clients cannot drive socket.io frames.

# 1) Login (Ф1) — JWT pair into {{accessToken}}, {{refreshToken}}.
# @name login
POST {{apiBase}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{gmEmail}}",
  "password": "{{gmPassword}}"
}

###

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

# 2) Create room (Ф2.1) — owner becomes GM by ownership.
# @name createRoom
POST {{apiBase}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Smoke Room",
  "gameSystem": "D&D 5e"
}

###

@roomId = {{createRoom.response.body.id}}

# 3) Create scene (Ф3.1) — empty 40x40 scene.
# @name createScene
POST {{apiBase}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/scenes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Smoke Scene",
  "gridSize": 50,
  "gridWidth": 40,
  "gridHeight": 40
}

###

@sceneId = {{createScene.response.body.id}}

# 4) Activate scene (Ф3.2) — fires SceneService.onSceneActivated → audio:play.
PATCH {{apiBase}}/scenes/{{sceneId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}

###

# 5) Get scene (Ф3.3) — verify projection + tokens[] visible to GM.
GET {{apiBase}}/scenes/{{sceneId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

# 6) Roll dice via WSS — see ./socket-smoke.mjs (run with the same accessToken).

# 7) Generate AI image (Ф8.2) — Gemini 3.1 Flash Image, persists into Asset.
POST {{apiBase}}/ai/generate-image
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
  "prompt": "ancient stone bridge over a river, top-down battle map, 1024x1024"
}

###

# 8) Upload audio track (Ф6.1) — two-phase: presigned PUT, then finalize.
# 8a — request presigned URL.
# @name presignAudio
POST {{apiBase}}/audio
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
  "title": "Tavern Loop",
  "mimeType": "audio/mpeg",
  "size": 4194304
}

###

# 8b — PUT bytes directly to GCS using {{presignAudio.response.body.uploadUrl}}.
#       Use a real client (curl --upload-file) outside this file:
#       curl -X PUT -H "Content-Type: audio/mpeg" --upload-file ./tavern.mp3 "<uploadUrl>"

# 8c — finalize: confirms object presence in GCS and links AudioTrack.
POST {{apiBase}}/audio/{{presignAudio.response.body.audioTrackId}}/finalize
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
